@startuml mo_senate_bills
title mo_senate_bills: MO Senate bill list, actions and document lists
start
:years of the lookback window;
:GET senate.mo.gov/BillTracking/Bills/BillList?year=YYYY&session=R
then E1, E2, ... until one is empty
(3-6 MB, every shard, once, from the shared cache);
note right
  The bill list is the JSON in
  "const bills = [...]" in a script element.
  billId is not the bill number.
end note
:bills of every session;
:keep the bills this shard owns
(hash of year/session/billId);
repeat
  :GET BillList?billId=N&year=YYYY&billPrefix=SB&billSuffix=1&handler=Actions
  (~1 request/s host-wide, shared by all shards,
  current year cached 1 day, past years 30 days);
  :parse the action table (newest first):
  date, action, journal ref and link;
  :GET the same URL with handler=BillText, FiscalNotes,
  Amendments, Summaries (4 more requests, skipped when
  MOGOV_SENATE_BILL_DOCS=0; an error page is not cached);
  :parse each list: one row per link or summary;
repeat while (more owned bills?)
:mo_senate_bill_list (one row per bill)
mo_senate_bill_actions (one row per action)
mo_senate_bill_texts, _fiscal_notes, _amendments (one row per link)
mo_senate_bill_summaries (one row per summary);
stop
@enduml
